      "narration_text": "Here is the idea of this film. Claude's defaults are polished, because it has read a million pages — and generic, because the choices were not the teacher's. The fix is not a better prompt. It is three short files, written before Claude touches anything: what it may not do; what it must look and feel like; and who this is for and what done means. Same one-sentence ask, with and without them. You will see the difference in the diff.",
