      "narration_text": "Check the bare page against a definition of done — a script the teacher wrote. Five failures, not one. Two font families. An autoplay loop the teacher never asked for. A speed slider. Four buttons where one was needed. And twelve colours from the tailwind palette; not the classroom's. Not wrong. Not the teacher's. Nobody told it otherwise, and it filled the silence with the internet's average dashboard.",
